{%- comment -%}
  The per-product card slot of sections/mionas-product-list.liquid: a Mionas card shell whose
  contents are merchant-composed child blocks, not baked-in markup.

  Mirrors ../design-system/src/react/ProductCard/ProductCard.tsx's `as="a"` mode -- the whole card is
  the link to the product -- while still accepting arbitrary children, which is the combination the
  earlier all-in-one version could not offer.

  WHY THIS IS PRIVATE (leading underscore):
  it reads closest.product and would render nothing outside a product context, so it must not appear
  in the merchant's block picker. It is reached only through the section's
  content_for 'block', type: '_mionas-product-card', id: 'static-product-card' -- the same mechanism
  sections/mionas-split-panel.liquid uses for its two `group` sides and
  sections/mionas-google-reviews.liquid for its card and summary. One fixed id shared by every
  iteration means the theme editor shows a single card whose composition governs every product.

  WHY IT DOES NOT RENDER THROUGH snippets/group.liquid, unlike blocks/mionas-card.liquid:
  group.liquid takes the link from `settings.link`, a static URL setting (group.liquid:44-51), and
  there is no parameter to override it. In a loop every card would point at the same product. group
  is a native snippet, so it cannot be given one. The shell below is therefore the card's own, with
  the href bound to closest.product -- but the overlay-link technique is copied verbatim from
  group.liquid:82-97, including the pointer-events handling, so a child block that contains its own
  link or button (a title, a swatch, a badge) stays clickable instead of being swallowed by the
  overlay. That is what makes the card wholly clickable AND composable at the same time; an <a>
  wrapping the children would forbid any link inside it.

  The card chrome (background, border, radius, shadow) comes from the same --card-base-* tokens as
  blocks/mionas-card.liquid, so a composed product card and a hand-composed Mionas: Card are the same
  object visually.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product = closest.product
-%}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  <div
    class="mionas-product-card spacing-style"
    style="
      {% render 'spacing-style', settings: block.settings %}
      --mionas-product-card-gap: {{ block.settings.gap }}px;
    "
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    {%- comment -%}
      Empty overlay link, exactly as group.liquid and snippets/product-card.liquid do it. It carries
      the accessible name so a screen reader announces the product rather than an unnamed link, and
      the child title is then free to be plain text.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <a class="mionas-product-card__link" href="{{ product.url }}" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}"></a>

    <div class="mionas-product-card__content">{%- content_for 'blocks' -%}</div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .mionas-product-card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--mionas-product-card-gap, var(--product-card-base-gap));
    background: var(--card-base-background);
    border: var(--card-base-border-width) solid var(--card-base-border-color);
    border-radius: var(--card-base-radius);
    box-shadow: var(--card-base-shadow);
    font-family: var(--card-base-font-family);
    overflow: hidden;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .mionas-product-card:active {
    opacity: var(--card-state-pressed-opacity);
  }

  .mionas-product-card__link {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .mionas-product-card__content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--mionas-product-card-gap, var(--product-card-base-gap));
  }

  /* Copied from snippets/group.liquid:88-93. Clicks pass through the composed children to the
     overlay link, except on genuinely interactive elements, which keep their own behaviour. */
  .mionas-product-card__link ~ .mionas-product-card__content {
    pointer-events: none;

    :is(a, button, input, textarea, select) {
      pointer-events: auto;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Mionas: Product card",
  "tag": null,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "@theme"
    },
    {
      "type": "@app"
    },
    {
      "type": "_divider"
    }
  ],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "gap",
      "label": "t:settings.vertical_gap",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "t:settings.top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "t:settings.bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-inline-start",
      "label": "t:settings.left",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-inline-end",
      "label": "t:settings.right",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
